WEBVTT

00:00:07.660 --> 00:00:09.160
That's ridiculous!

00:00:09.160 --> 00:00:10.750
If they don't like it, they can leave!

00:00:10.750 --> 00:00:12.370
Poverty and oppression are--

00:00:12.370 --> 00:00:13.660
Calm down for a moment.

00:00:13.660 --> 00:00:15.660
Let's see what the people think.

00:00:15.660 --> 00:00:20.950
I'm voting for Coal Mozeleemay.
He cares about rights for Semanians.

00:00:20.950 --> 00:00:24.290
They say a Semanian shot Kahns!

00:00:24.290 --> 00:00:27.330
I'm voting for Tourte!
I want the aliens out of here.

00:00:27.330 --> 00:00:31.660
I don't care who it is, as long as
they reduce crime in San-Teresa!

00:00:31.660 --> 00:00:35.620
Interest in the upcoming mayoral
elections continues to rise...

00:00:35.620 --> 00:00:39.700
It's what the people want!
Every day there are more anti-Semanian protests.

00:00:39.700 --> 00:00:42.200
--It's violence. And it won't solve anything.
--So this is democracy?

00:00:42.200 --> 00:00:44.910
--The other day, there was an unfortunate incident...
--We're leaving.

00:00:44.910 --> 00:00:46.700
--But the real cause is...
--Okay.

00:00:52.950 --> 00:00:57.620
Fifteen years ago, a hyperspace gate
appeared in the middle of the Pacific.

00:00:57.620 --> 00:01:02.910
Beyond the gate lay a strange world
filled with fairies and monsters.

00:01:02.910 --> 00:01:05.250
Kariaena Island. The city of San-Teresa.

00:01:05.250 --> 00:01:08.540
This city is Earth's "front door."

00:01:08.540 --> 00:01:11.120
Over two million citizens
from both worlds live here.

00:01:11.120 --> 00:01:15.620
A mixture of different races and
diverse cultures, haves and have-nots...

00:01:15.620 --> 00:01:19.160
The world's newest "city of dreams."

00:01:19.160 --> 00:01:23.620
But in the shadows of all this chaos
lurked countless crimes.

00:01:23.620 --> 00:01:25.200
Drugs. Prostitution.

00:01:25.200 --> 00:01:26.540
Weapons smuggling.

00:01:26.540 --> 00:01:29.500
The San-Teresa Metropolitan Police maintained

00:01:29.500 --> 00:01:32.540
a special unit to deal with these crimes.

00:03:05.200 --> 00:03:06.910
I see.

00:03:06.910 --> 00:03:08.500
Sorry, but do it.

00:03:10.160 --> 00:03:14.660
They can't get any info at all
on the gun that shot Kahns.

00:03:14.660 --> 00:03:16.080
What do you mean?

00:03:16.080 --> 00:03:23.750
They should be able to guess even if it were
smuggled or stolen. But they have nothing.

00:03:23.750 --> 00:03:26.290
It's a common weapon. But then...

00:03:33.330 --> 00:03:36.200
What an obnoxious poster.

00:03:36.200 --> 00:03:40.040
I'm starting to wonder if
he's not that bad a guy.

00:03:40.040 --> 00:03:41.160
Are you serious?

00:03:41.160 --> 00:03:42.750
I'm just being sarcastic.

00:03:44.620 --> 00:03:45.700
We're here.

00:03:58.500 --> 00:04:01.700
Kei, if we meet Mozeleemay...

00:04:01.700 --> 00:04:04.200
Forget about Zoey for now.

00:04:09.700 --> 00:04:10.790
But...

00:04:13.000 --> 00:04:16.160
Remember why we're here today.

00:04:16.160 --> 00:04:18.830
Any of those "dead guys" around?

00:04:20.790 --> 00:04:22.250
No, it seems.

00:04:22.250 --> 00:04:24.870
I don't smell any latena.

00:04:24.870 --> 00:04:26.160
Detective Matoba?

00:04:27.160 --> 00:04:29.620
You're... Randall, right?

00:04:29.620 --> 00:04:32.080
Yup. Kevin Randall.

00:04:32.080 --> 00:04:33.330
It's been a while.

00:04:33.330 --> 00:04:37.540
He's a journalist. He interviewed me once.

00:04:37.540 --> 00:04:40.830
See you later, Randall. Sorry, I'm on the clock.

00:04:40.830 --> 00:04:45.700
They got you on the case
of the murdered mayoral candidate?

00:04:45.700 --> 00:04:47.160
No comment.

00:04:47.160 --> 00:04:50.160
Are you Matoba's new partner?

00:04:50.160 --> 00:04:53.580
You look like a Semanian.

00:04:53.580 --> 00:04:54.330
I'm...

00:04:54.330 --> 00:04:56.080
No comment.

00:04:59.200 --> 00:05:00.750
Detective Matoba!

00:05:00.750 --> 00:05:03.450
I'll send you an email. Let's talk soon.

00:05:03.450 --> 00:05:05.500
Sure, sure.

00:05:05.500 --> 00:05:08.290
It's important, really.

00:05:08.290 --> 00:05:10.120
Read my message.

00:05:11.910 --> 00:05:15.620
So I told him, "Okay,
but you have to vote for me..."

00:05:15.620 --> 00:05:16.750
Who's there?

00:05:17.870 --> 00:05:20.330
Matoba with the San-Teresa police.

00:05:20.330 --> 00:05:21.910
Good to see you again.

00:05:23.830 --> 00:05:27.620
Sorry, guys, I need some privacy.

00:05:27.620 --> 00:05:28.660
Okay.

00:05:31.330 --> 00:05:33.910
So you were a detective, huh?

00:05:33.910 --> 00:05:35.500
Yup.

00:05:35.500 --> 00:05:39.450
I'd like to talk about the mayoral race...

00:05:39.450 --> 00:05:42.000
I've got nothing to say.

00:05:42.000 --> 00:05:44.870
If you have questions,
send an email to my staff.

00:05:44.870 --> 00:05:47.830
Oh, why not talk to them?

00:05:47.830 --> 00:05:48.950
Marla...

00:05:51.700 --> 00:05:55.200
You have nothing to hide.

00:05:55.200 --> 00:05:57.450
So act like it.

00:05:57.450 --> 00:06:02.620
You're the great politician who rose up
to help Semanians in poverty.

00:06:02.620 --> 00:06:05.330
Now ask your questions, Detective.

00:06:05.330 --> 00:06:10.120
Okay, let's start with Kahns,
the murdered candidate.

00:06:10.120 --> 00:06:10.700
It was...

00:06:10.700 --> 00:06:13.120
A terrible shame.

00:06:13.120 --> 00:06:16.540
Since it happened, we've been
doing thorough checks of everyone

00:06:16.540 --> 00:06:19.750
who comes on to the premises.

00:06:19.750 --> 00:06:26.000
The rumor is that you'll get at least
200,000 votes now that he's dead.

00:06:26.000 --> 00:06:27.830
Any comments on that?

00:06:27.830 --> 00:06:32.790
Our polling shows that Tourte
will be getting 300,000.

00:06:32.790 --> 00:06:35.080
My husband is in danger of losing the election.

00:06:35.080 --> 00:06:38.330
We're trying to find a way
to turn things around.

00:06:38.330 --> 00:06:43.080
So if Tourte bites it next,
you won't have to worry about that.

00:06:43.080 --> 00:06:47.120
Detective, we're civilized people.

00:06:47.120 --> 00:06:49.830
If we tried to resolve
differences of opinion with guns,

00:06:49.830 --> 00:06:52.120
the whole town would turn into a battlefield...

00:06:52.120 --> 00:06:56.410
With the power to control the dead,
you wouldn't need weapons.

00:06:56.410 --> 00:06:58.000
Control the dead?

00:06:58.000 --> 00:07:01.870
I've heard that there are mildey like that.

00:07:01.870 --> 00:07:07.000
But you're aware that normal
Semanians can't use it, right?

00:07:07.000 --> 00:07:08.580
Bonah Exedilica.

00:07:11.200 --> 00:07:14.870
I'm afraid we're out of time.
Please leave. Right, honey?

00:07:14.870 --> 00:07:16.410
R-Right.

00:07:19.580 --> 00:07:20.700
What's your take?

00:07:20.700 --> 00:07:25.580
I was reminded of the fact that
Coal Mozeleemay is no leader.

00:07:25.580 --> 00:07:29.660
Yeah. His wife's got him by the balls.

00:07:29.660 --> 00:07:31.830
--If anything...
--You felt it too?

00:07:31.830 --> 00:07:33.910
Marla Mozeleemay.

00:07:33.910 --> 00:07:35.790
She stinks worse than her perfume.

00:07:35.790 --> 00:07:37.830
Then Zoey was also...

00:07:37.830 --> 00:07:41.410
Calm down. Right now we want more info.

00:07:41.410 --> 00:07:43.910
I'd like to talk to Tourte too.

00:07:48.160 --> 00:07:50.870
Wait! We need to figure out
what's going on first.

00:07:54.120 --> 00:07:56.580
San-Teresa police. Help us out.

00:07:56.580 --> 00:07:59.080
Detectives? Um...

00:07:59.080 --> 00:08:00.830
Who was shot?

00:08:00.830 --> 00:08:02.790
M-Mr. Mozeleemay.

00:08:02.790 --> 00:08:05.830
The opening speech just concluded
and he got on the stage.

00:08:05.830 --> 00:08:06.830
Look.

00:08:21.910 --> 00:08:23.290
Can you follow the perp?

00:08:23.290 --> 00:08:25.000
W-We're trying.

00:08:25.000 --> 00:08:29.580
But I don't know whether
we can ID him with our AI...

00:08:29.580 --> 00:08:32.120
I used his clothing and body size
to run a search,

00:08:32.120 --> 00:08:34.950
but there are 91 candidates. No, 92.

00:08:34.950 --> 00:08:36.200
Walking speed.

00:08:37.250 --> 00:08:39.290
Eliminate anybody moving over 10 kmph.

00:08:39.290 --> 00:08:41.790
Or anybody who pushed
the person in front of them.

00:08:41.790 --> 00:08:44.200
At times like this, assassins don't run.

00:08:44.200 --> 00:08:47.830
They try to blend in with the fleeing crowds.

00:08:47.830 --> 00:08:49.830
We're down to 31.

00:08:49.830 --> 00:08:52.540
Now try the number of times they turn around.

00:08:52.540 --> 00:08:56.120
Eliminate anyone who turns
around three times in ten seconds.

00:08:56.120 --> 00:08:57.370
Seventeen.

00:08:57.370 --> 00:09:01.910
Excited people open their mouths.
Eliminate them too.

00:09:01.910 --> 00:09:03.250
We're down to three.

00:09:03.250 --> 00:09:04.870
Let me see them.

00:09:11.700 --> 00:09:13.540
Where's this guy?

00:09:13.540 --> 00:09:18.040
In the north side lobby on the first floor.
He may have already fled outside...

00:09:20.080 --> 00:09:22.040
--Where's the north side lobby?
--That way!

00:09:22.040 --> 00:09:24.040
Shield of law, protection of the war god.

00:09:29.370 --> 00:09:32.910
This is a dangerous area!
Follow instructions and...

00:09:32.910 --> 00:09:35.120
This is the police! Make way!

00:09:35.910 --> 00:09:37.540
Calm down!

00:09:37.540 --> 00:09:38.540
Hey!

00:09:39.870 --> 00:09:41.540
Water. Sand. Water. Light.

00:09:41.870 --> 00:09:42.950
Ripples of scent.

00:09:43.080 --> 00:09:44.290
Remnants of color.

00:09:44.290 --> 00:09:45.750
Water. Sand. Water. Light.

00:09:46.080 --> 00:09:47.080
Ripples of scent.

00:09:47.250 --> 00:09:48.500
Remnants of color.

00:09:54.330 --> 00:09:55.660
There, Kei!

00:09:57.250 --> 00:09:59.580
You in the black suit, stop!

00:09:59.580 --> 00:10:01.540
Hands above your head, nice and slow--

00:10:01.540 --> 00:10:02.700
Kei, shoot!

00:10:04.910 --> 00:10:05.910
Shit!

00:10:06.410 --> 00:10:07.790
Kizenya!

00:10:14.580 --> 00:10:15.790
Damn it all!

00:10:21.370 --> 00:10:22.910
Kei, let's follow him!

00:10:32.750 --> 00:10:34.700
Damn it... Something's...

00:10:42.660 --> 00:10:45.160
--Let me borrow your car!
--I-I don't have any money!

00:10:45.160 --> 00:10:47.040
No, I'm with the police!

00:10:47.040 --> 00:10:48.500
I'm borrowing your car!

00:10:48.500 --> 00:10:50.450
Please don't crash it...

00:10:53.290 --> 00:10:55.120
Thank you for your cooperation!

00:11:01.620 --> 00:11:03.750
Tilarna Exedilica's current location.

00:11:14.620 --> 00:11:17.080
V-21 to HQ!

00:11:17.080 --> 00:11:20.330
I am in pursuit of the suspect
who shot Coal Mozeleemay,

00:11:20.330 --> 00:11:23.540
in the vicinity of New Compton.

00:11:23.540 --> 00:11:27.200
Suspect is a Semanian male, approximately 5'9".

00:11:27.200 --> 00:11:30.370
Wearing a black suit. Suspect is armed.

00:11:30.370 --> 00:11:33.450
Roger. Sending nearby cars as backup.

00:11:33.450 --> 00:11:34.660
Hurry, please!

00:11:47.540 --> 00:11:48.580
There!

00:12:11.120 --> 00:12:12.370
Don't move!

00:12:49.080 --> 00:12:51.700
Curses of Beyadah upon you!

00:12:51.700 --> 00:12:52.830
Don't!

00:12:56.330 --> 00:12:57.910
Kei, why did you stop me?

00:12:57.910 --> 00:13:01.080
'Cause you were about
to commit a murder. Cool it.

00:13:01.080 --> 00:13:03.370
More fundamental rights?

00:13:03.370 --> 00:13:05.790
I'm asking you to do your best.

00:13:05.790 --> 00:13:07.910
Even if it ends up with a bad result.

00:13:09.370 --> 00:13:11.000
I'll remember that.

00:13:11.000 --> 00:13:12.040
But...

00:13:16.620 --> 00:13:20.200
Do you honestly expect him
to tell us who's behind this?

00:13:20.200 --> 00:13:25.160
Any last words? I'll listen.

00:13:25.160 --> 00:13:26.580
Oh, Leeze...

00:13:26.580 --> 00:13:28.540
What?

00:13:28.540 --> 00:13:30.120
I thank you.

00:13:32.950 --> 00:13:34.040
What?

00:13:35.330 --> 00:13:37.040
What's going on?

00:13:37.040 --> 00:13:38.410
Mildina zarhf.

00:13:38.410 --> 00:13:39.660
What?

00:13:39.660 --> 00:13:41.580
Transformation magic.

00:13:41.580 --> 00:13:43.830
It seems to have worn off partway through.

00:13:43.830 --> 00:13:46.250
I noticed when I was chasing him.

00:13:46.250 --> 00:13:48.370
This guy's from Earth!

00:13:48.370 --> 00:13:51.000
Yeah. And a warrior.

00:13:51.000 --> 00:13:55.290
He was using mildey of his
own free will as he fought me.

00:13:55.290 --> 00:14:00.200
Zelada's puppets couldn't do that.

00:14:00.200 --> 00:14:02.950
A human... using magic?

00:14:02.950 --> 00:14:06.950
Elbaji learned human science just fine.

00:14:06.950 --> 00:14:09.660
Which means the reverse is probably possible.

00:14:09.660 --> 00:14:10.660
Yeah.

00:14:13.540 --> 00:14:15.080
Let me see that.

00:14:15.080 --> 00:14:16.750
It smells of latena.

00:14:18.200 --> 00:14:20.200
Don't touch the trigger.

00:14:22.200 --> 00:14:24.370
Take out the bullets.

00:14:24.370 --> 00:14:27.580
It's evidence, you know. Don't tell anyone.

00:14:28.620 --> 00:14:30.200
Spin. Spin. Spin.

00:14:30.660 --> 00:14:33.450
In the name of the god of the forge.

00:14:33.870 --> 00:14:35.370
Spin. Spin. Now, spin.

00:14:36.120 --> 00:14:37.910
What the hell?

00:14:42.000 --> 00:14:44.370
What is this?

00:14:44.370 --> 00:14:46.250
Vaifaht steel.

00:14:46.250 --> 00:14:47.830
Vaifaht...?

00:14:49.250 --> 00:14:51.120
In the name of the god of the forge.

00:14:51.540 --> 00:14:53.160
Spin. Spin. Now, spin.

00:14:55.620 --> 00:14:57.580
The gunpowder, too?

00:14:57.580 --> 00:15:00.870
Sheesh... Vaifaht steel is holy.

00:15:00.870 --> 00:15:03.160
It shouldn't be used for such ridiculous things.

00:15:05.450 --> 00:15:11.370
So that's how he got a gun through
a heavily secured entrance, huh?

00:15:11.370 --> 00:15:13.910
The techniques used were extremely fine.

00:15:13.910 --> 00:15:18.910
The greatest vaifaht blacksmiths
in my country couldn't make this.

00:15:18.910 --> 00:15:20.620
Turn it back.

00:15:20.620 --> 00:15:22.160
But...

00:15:22.160 --> 00:15:25.080
Just do it, for now.

00:15:26.290 --> 00:15:27.410
Got it.

00:15:28.790 --> 00:15:30.040
Spin. Spin. Spin.

00:15:30.580 --> 00:15:32.250
In the name of the god of the forge.

00:15:32.870 --> 00:15:34.410
Spin. Spin. Now, spin.

00:15:35.540 --> 00:15:37.620
One more thing.

00:15:37.620 --> 00:15:40.290
The last word he said, "Leeze"--

00:15:40.290 --> 00:15:42.160
Hold it right there.

00:15:42.160 --> 00:15:45.330
Don't move. This is the FBI.

00:15:45.330 --> 00:15:49.160
That's pretty bossy.
Is that how you treat a fellow cop?

00:15:55.700 --> 00:16:00.750
I don't consider morons who
kill their suspects "fellow cops."

00:16:00.750 --> 00:16:02.370
Hey, what are you doing--

00:16:02.370 --> 00:16:05.540
This case is under our jurisdiction.

00:16:05.540 --> 00:16:08.080
So get your city cop ass out of here.

00:16:08.080 --> 00:16:09.370
Thanks.

00:16:20.040 --> 00:16:21.620
You're late.

00:16:32.120 --> 00:16:34.290
You kept your mouth shut, right?

00:16:35.450 --> 00:16:40.910
Kei, shouldn't you be saying
something to me first?

00:16:40.910 --> 00:16:42.830
You seem upset.

00:16:42.830 --> 00:16:45.120
You're not?

00:16:45.120 --> 00:16:46.790
I'm regretting my life choices.

00:16:46.790 --> 00:16:52.700
When Coal was shot, I should've pretended
I was deaf and just gone and got lunch.

00:16:52.700 --> 00:16:55.580
Pathetic. And you call yourself
a representative of justice?

00:16:55.580 --> 00:16:57.080
That's enough.

00:16:57.080 --> 00:16:59.290
Both of you, I want reports on my desk.

00:16:59.290 --> 00:17:01.370
By 1900 tonight.

00:17:01.370 --> 00:17:04.750
So, are we off the case?

00:17:04.750 --> 00:17:06.330
Not a chance.

00:17:06.330 --> 00:17:09.000
I'm not letting you run off
and do it on your own.

00:17:09.000 --> 00:17:13.250
They got the body,
but we have the face photo you took.

00:17:13.250 --> 00:17:15.450
It's not the best clue, but it's a clue.

00:17:15.450 --> 00:17:17.370
I did good work, didn't I?

00:17:17.370 --> 00:17:18.910
That wasn't a compliment.

00:17:18.910 --> 00:17:22.620
If only you'd done a better job
of cornering the suspect...

00:17:22.620 --> 00:17:23.910
Right, right.

00:17:23.910 --> 00:17:27.080
Inspector, that was impossible!

00:17:27.080 --> 00:17:30.950
Our opponent was a dangerous
warrior who could use mildey too!

00:17:30.950 --> 00:17:33.080
The mere fact that he didn't escape...

00:17:33.080 --> 00:17:34.750
Right, right.

00:17:37.080 --> 00:17:39.370
Coal Mozeleemay's dead.

00:17:39.370 --> 00:17:43.620
The EMTs got him to Patterson Hospital,
and he just passed away there.

00:17:43.620 --> 00:17:45.910
What a mess.

00:17:45.910 --> 00:17:48.950
The commissioner's getting ready
for a press conference.

00:17:48.950 --> 00:17:52.500
If you're curious, go see your ex later.

00:17:52.500 --> 00:17:54.450
She's probably surrounded by a bunch of VIPs

00:17:54.450 --> 00:17:57.410
and telling them the size
of the guy's ass again.

00:17:57.410 --> 00:17:59.950
I'll pass.

00:17:59.950 --> 00:18:01.620
We're heading back to the station, Tilarna.

00:18:01.620 --> 00:18:02.580
Right.

00:18:02.580 --> 00:18:03.660
Matoba!

00:18:03.660 --> 00:18:05.080
What?

00:18:05.080 --> 00:18:07.250
You're not hiding something, are you?

00:18:09.700 --> 00:18:13.870
Well... actually, we are.

00:18:13.870 --> 00:18:15.410
Hey.

00:18:15.410 --> 00:18:17.620
But I don't want to say it here.

00:18:17.620 --> 00:18:19.450
I'll tell you in the office.

00:18:23.540 --> 00:18:25.370
It's extremely difficult to explain

00:18:25.370 --> 00:18:28.950
to an Earthling what exactly vaifaht steel is.

00:18:28.950 --> 00:18:31.830
The closest thing you have
is what you just explained to me,

00:18:31.830 --> 00:18:34.040
the shape memory alloys.

00:18:34.040 --> 00:18:38.910
But it changes its form in response
to latena, not temperature.

00:18:38.910 --> 00:18:41.040
Magic metal?

00:18:41.040 --> 00:18:43.830
Ridiculous. Totally ridiculous.

00:18:43.830 --> 00:18:45.950
Calm down, please.

00:18:45.950 --> 00:18:49.160
Vaifaht steel is extracted from certain trees,

00:18:49.160 --> 00:18:51.750
and at the start of the process
has a cotton-like shape.

00:18:51.750 --> 00:18:55.750
It's turned into thin, strong stands...

00:18:55.750 --> 00:18:58.700
I get it. You weave it, like cloth.

00:18:58.700 --> 00:18:59.790
Correct.

00:18:59.790 --> 00:19:02.500
It's woven into cloth with a special loom.

00:19:02.500 --> 00:19:05.910
At this point, the final shape of
the item you're making is decided.

00:19:05.910 --> 00:19:10.120
Sometimes it's art, but... usually it's weapons.

00:19:12.700 --> 00:19:14.750
O gods of war and the forge.

00:19:15.120 --> 00:19:16.660
Bring peace and protect me.

00:19:20.580 --> 00:19:21.870
Wow!

00:19:21.870 --> 00:19:26.080
Um... the mass itself doesn't change, right?

00:19:26.080 --> 00:19:28.080
O gods of the forge and war.

00:19:28.500 --> 00:19:30.000
Bring peace and make me beautiful.

00:19:31.750 --> 00:19:35.500
As a fellow coworker, I'll give you
the special privilege of touching it.

00:19:38.830 --> 00:19:40.580
It's heavy!

00:19:40.580 --> 00:19:45.750
Vaifaht steel weapons are woven
by specially trained Lahge craftsmen.

00:19:45.750 --> 00:19:49.450
No two are alike.

00:19:49.450 --> 00:19:52.750
I'm amazed you don't get stiff
shoulders wearing this all the time.

00:19:52.750 --> 00:19:54.870
It's because I train daily.

00:19:54.870 --> 00:19:58.250
Maybe that's why you stopped growing.

00:19:59.250 --> 00:20:06.000
So what I'm hearing is that
vaifaht steel items are difficult to make.

00:20:06.000 --> 00:20:11.540
Correct. Creating something filled
with precision parts, like a gun,

00:20:11.540 --> 00:20:17.160
would be impossible even for the Lahge.

00:20:17.160 --> 00:20:22.370
That gun is a hybrid of Earth
and Semanian technology, then.

00:20:22.370 --> 00:20:27.410
Is it possible that one of these Lahge guys
is working with someone from Earth?

00:20:29.540 --> 00:20:31.540
Well...

00:20:31.540 --> 00:20:32.750
It's possible.

00:20:32.750 --> 00:20:36.620
Without the help of someone
who knows Earth technology,

00:20:36.620 --> 00:20:39.620
you probably couldn't make something like that.

00:20:41.830 --> 00:20:44.620
Okay, we know what to do, then.

00:20:44.620 --> 00:20:49.160
Get to work on the investigation. Dismissed.

00:20:49.160 --> 00:20:50.790
Oh, Matoba.

00:20:50.790 --> 00:20:52.330
Yeah?

00:20:52.330 --> 00:20:55.750
Go visit Tourte tomorrow.

00:20:55.750 --> 00:20:58.040
I got permission for an interview.

00:21:07.500 --> 00:21:10.040
I'm not sure what you want me to say.

00:21:10.040 --> 00:21:11.250
No, I don't know.

00:21:13.290 --> 00:21:15.160
I don't know. I'm hanging up.

00:21:15.160 --> 00:21:16.660
Who was that?

00:21:16.660 --> 00:21:18.660
An officer from precinct 14.

00:21:18.660 --> 00:21:21.750
They got a complaint from
the owner of that three-wheeler.

00:21:23.410 --> 00:21:26.000
They said he was very mad.

00:21:26.000 --> 00:21:27.250
What do we do?

00:21:27.250 --> 00:21:29.200
L-Let's ignore it.

00:21:31.450 --> 00:21:51.370
Go home! Go home! ET go home!

00:21:51.370 --> 00:21:54.580
--Go home! Go home! ET go home!
--I don't want any trouble, okay?

00:21:54.580 --> 00:21:55.370
--Go home! Go home! ET go home!
--Ignore them.

00:21:55.370 --> 00:21:59.500
--Go home! Go home! ET go home!
--I know.

00:21:59.500 --> 00:22:06.910
Go home! Go home! ET go home!

00:23:42.790 --> 00:23:44.410
"Next time"
